  (:NAME "MULTIPLE-VALUE-COMPOSE" :KIND :FUNCTION :LAMBDA-LIST "(function &rest more-functions)" :DOCSTRING "Returns a function composed of FUNCTION and MORE-FUNCTIONS that applies
