  (:NAME "MULTIPLE-VALUE-PROG2" :KIND :MACRO :LAMBDA-LIST "(first-form second-form &body forms)" :DOCSTRING "Evaluates FIRST-FORM, then SECOND-FORM, and then FORMS. Yields as its value
