property list PLIST in the same order." :ORIGIN "alexandria")
  (:NAME "PLIST-HASH-TABLE" :KIND :FUNCTION :LAMBDA-LIST "(plist &rest hash-table-initargs)" :DOCSTRING "Returns a hash table containing the keys and values of the property list
PLIST. Hash table is initialized using the HASH-TABLE-INITARGS." :ORIGIN "alexandria")
  (:NAME "POSITIVE-DOUBLE-FLOAT" :KIND :TYPE :DOCSTRING "Type specifier denoting the double-float range from 0.0d0 to +inf." :ORIGIN "alexandria")
