  (:NAME "RANDOM-ELT" :KIND :FUNCTION :LAMBDA-LIST "(sequence &key (start 0) end)" :DOCSTRING "Returns a random element from SEQUENCE bounded by START and END. Signals an
error if the SEQUENCE is not a proper non-empty sequence, or if END and START
are not proper bounding index designators for SEQUENCE." :ORIGIN "alexandria")
  (:NAME "RASSOC-VALUE" :KIND :FUNCTION :LAMBDA-LIST "(alist key &key (test 'eql))" :DOCSTRING "RASSOC-VALUE is an alist accessor very much like RASSOC, but it can
